    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Sagal Salad carries herself with grace and humility. Do not be fooled by her demeanour, she carries a huge crown - Somali a's first female pathologist. Dr  Salad graduated with a Master of Medicine degree in anatomical pathology from AKU. We caught up with her at the February convocation in Nairobi to know more about her story.",
